    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ier40">
        <head xml:id="gom-ier40-Hd1e98">Caput 40</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier40-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier40-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier40-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier40-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier40_1@1-4">Sermo qui factus est,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-ier40-Qd1e109"><seg type="qs">Quaeritur <pb ed="#P" n="0051B"/> quomodo hic sermo Domini</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">juxta sermonem Domini liberatus est.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier40-Dd1e120">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier40-Hd1e122">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier40-d1e124">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier40-Qd1e126" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier40_2@1-2">Tollens ergo.</quote>
            Descripta vastatione urbis, et interitu, et captivitate populi, et perfidia regis, sequitur quid de Jeremia factum sit, et de reliquiis populi, quas propheta monuit ex verbo Domini sedere in terra sua, et servire regi Babylonis, ipsi vero maluerunt ire in Aegyptum, ubi eos postea Nabuchodonosor trucidavit, et ipsam Aegyptum vastavit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ier40-Dd1e131">
          <head xml:id="gom-ier40-Hd1e133">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ier40-d1e135">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier40-Qd1e137" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ier40_3@17-20">Et factus est vobis.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ier40-Qd1e140"><seg type="qs">Ex hoc etiam loco manifestum est Deum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Dei vero sententiam justam praedicabant.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
